# The 58503B's blocks that are the 58503A's rather than the Z3805A's
# (58503b-trace.md, "The 1 PPS divider" and "The sync field"), checked
# by `make -f tools/fpga/Makefile check-blocks` (blockmatch.py).
#
# DH, the GPS 1 PPS's rising-edge detector, its flip-flops where the
# 58503A has them; HJ, the pulse's end.
pair DH
pair HJ
# HK, the 1 PPS's set-and-hold, is the 58503A's EI, with HH.Y for the
# terminal and FH.X, P83's register, for P83's own pad.
pair HK EI
rename HK.X EI.Y
rename HH.X HH.Y
rename HH.Y HH.X
rename FH.X PAD14.I
